      "name": "Z-Back Axis Bench Build",
      "description": "Assembles the Z-back axis module from individual parts. Z-Back uses the same plastic piece type as Y-Left. No endstop is attached to Z axes. Produces a complete Z-back axis module ready for mounting on the back frame face directly behind Z-front.",
